# Auth
HEXCLAVE_BULLDOZER_SERVER_SECRET=# shared secret callers (the backend) must present as `Authorization: Bearer <secret>`. Must match the backend's value. Required: bulldozer-js refuses to start if unset

# Sentry
BULLDOZER_JS_SENTRY_DSN=# error-reporting DSN for the bulldozer-js process. Leave empty to turn Sentry off. Falls back to SENTRY_DSN if unset
BULLDOZER_JS_SENTRY_ENVIRONMENT=# Sentry environment label for THIS deployment (e.g. "production", "staging", "dev"). Lets prod vs dev bulldozer be separated in Sentry even when both run NODE_ENV=production.

# Storage
# LZ4-compress LMDB values. Sticky per path: once enabled and written, keep it on. Prefer a fresh LMDB_PATH + backfill over flipping this on an existing prod store.
HEXCLAVE_BULLDOZER_JS_LMDB_COMPRESSION=1
HEXCLAVE_BULLDOZER_JS_LMDB_PATH=# folder for the on-disk LMDB store. Defaults to ./.data/bulldozer-js-lmdb
HEXCLAVE_BULLDOZER_JS_USE_TMP_LMDB=# set to 1 to put LMDB in a throwaway temp folder (fresh every run). Handy for tests
HEXCLAVE_BULLDOZER_JS_LOW_LEVEL_BACKEND=# set to "in-memory" to keep all data in RAM and skip LMDB. Any other value uses LMDB

# Engine / debugging
HEXCLAVE_BULLDOZER_JS_DISABLE_PILEDRIVER_HEAP_READ_CACHE=# set to 1 to disable the in-memory read cache (less memory, slower reads)
HEXCLAVE_BULLDOZER_JS_SIMULATE_READ_MISS_DELAY_MS=# add this many ms of fake delay to disk reads, to test slow storage. Empty = no delay
HEXCLAVE_BULLDOZER_EMIT_HANDLER_TIMING=# set to 1 to see how many ms each request took (added as an x-bulldozer-handler-ms response header)
